Meet Mali, our newest addition to Rhythm Culture. Mali specialises in biting, barking and looking super cute. She has already managed to accrue a fan base of Rhythm Culture students. Mali wont be attending camp due to animal restrictions and no students you can't puppy sit because you will be at Camp Afro Foli.

We have started working on the rhythm Dundunba with Mali. As you can see she will need some extra training. We are open to suggestions. For now, we will focus on the cute side of things and put any skill expectations to the side.
